#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create beautiful,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">accessible<br/><span class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>apps."
msgstr "Lag vakre,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">tilgjengelege<br/><span class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>applikasjonar."

#: index.md:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "Éin løyst token-modell, omforma til stilark, rammeverksbindingar, native-kode og payloads for designverktøy."

#: index.md:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Komme i gang"

#: index.md:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "CSS-referanse"

#: index.md:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API-referanse"

#: index.md:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Éin kjelde til sanning"

#: index.md:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr "Alle pakkar brukar dei offisielle Instructure-designtokn, komponentar og interaksjonar frå <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Bruk den minste pakken"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Installer berre @pantoken/css for eit stilark, @pantoken/react for hooks og ikonar, eller eit bundlar-preset for Tailwind, Panda, eller MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generer for alle plattformar"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr "Installer pantoken cli for å generera preset eller leggje til komponentar for alle plattformar&colon; web, nativt, og alt i mellom."

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr "React ikkje naudsynt"

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr "InstUI-biblioteket er tett kopla til React. Om du vil bruka det, må du bruka React. No kan du byggja overalt."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, overalt"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr "Kvar pakke les den same løyste token-IR-en. Endrar du eit token oppstraums, flyt det til CSS, SCSS, native-kode og Figma på same måte."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr "Køyr `pantoken generate` for å generere Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress og meir. Dei same tokena, i kvart økosystem si idiom."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Ingen oppstraumskopling"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr "Tokena blir leverte som vendoriserte statiske JSON-filer, så `npm i` hentar aldri frå ein GitHub-only kjelde. Publiserbar, semver-merka, offline-vennleg."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The package map"
#~ msgstr "Pakkekartet"
